{"title":"Oak Bed","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Carpentry Lv 38)</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Carpentry at level 38 <span class=\"muted\">(613 XP)</span> from 13× <a href=\"#/item/oak-plank\">Oak Plank</a>, 5× <a href=\"#/item/silver-fittings\">Silver Fittings</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/carpentry\">Carpentry</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/pine-bed\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/d0a29bd2e9f529eabca2.svg\" alt=\"\">Pine Bed</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-bed\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/b2afa0a13eb43dc81476.svg\" alt=\"\">Black Walnut Bed</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-bed\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/edcf85e8446090842cb5.svg\" alt=\"\">Shagbark Bed</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/oak-plank\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/dce8f2afedf4b949d972.svg\" alt=\"\">Oak Plank</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/244b1780fb1b3a85578c.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Fittings</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/f8a2186c6c7861d240a9.svg\" alt=\"Oak Bed\"></div><h3>Oak Bed</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Carpentry 38</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}